      "message": "Just for my knowledge: Does Zephyr check if pointer parameters are non-null?\n\nFrom [this comment](https://github.com/zephyrproject-rtos/zephyr/issues/21513#issuecomment-606780891), it looks like it might for syscalls, and I see these functions are marked with `__syscall`.",
